WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:01.331
(soft music)

00:00:01.331 --> 00:00:04.169
- [Narrator] In the cold
white north of Minnesota

00:00:04.169 --> 00:00:05.968
there's a place that will get you warm

00:00:05.968 --> 00:00:08.156
after a long day on the ice.

00:00:08.156 --> 00:00:10.248
You can do some fishing.

00:00:10.248 --> 00:00:12.331
Or have a tasty beverage.

00:00:13.538 --> 00:00:15.788
(cheering)

00:00:17.588 --> 00:00:19.868
And it's something of a dream for Josie.

00:00:19.868 --> 00:00:22.344
- I've always wanted to
own a neighborhood bar.

00:00:22.344 --> 00:00:27.094
And we finally do, mine is
just sitting on a frozen lake.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:35.421
Ice fishing is a way of
life around here for people.

00:00:35.421 --> 00:00:38.825
It gets so cold, below
zero temps quite often

00:00:38.825 --> 00:00:42.264
which allows us to
drive and put houses out

00:00:42.264 --> 00:00:45.347
and drill holes in the lake and fish.

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:49.534
- [Narrator] When it gets cold
enough in the early winter,

00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:53.046
Josie's husband goes out and tests the ice

00:00:53.046 --> 00:00:55.629
to make sure it's thick enough.

00:00:57.101 --> 00:00:59.410
If it is, they can put the bar together

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:01.910
and the the ice hole can open.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:04.755
The ice here is so thick

00:01:04.755 --> 00:01:06.277
that this bar sits on top of it.

00:01:06.277 --> 00:01:09.089
To come to our bar on the lake,

00:01:09.089 --> 00:01:11.102
you just drive your car
out on the ice and park

00:01:11.102 --> 00:01:13.436
we don't have a parking lot

00:01:13.436 --> 00:01:14.802
you just park wherever you want,

00:01:14.802 --> 00:01:15.764
walk in and have a beer.

00:01:15.764 --> 00:01:18.280
People like to fish and drink beer

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:20.559
and from our bar here, you can
do that all at the same time.

00:01:20.559 --> 00:01:24.892
The local favorite drink
is called the minnow shot.

00:01:25.961 --> 00:01:28.068
People will actually take a live minnow

00:01:28.068 --> 00:01:29.735
which is fishing bait,

00:01:29.735 --> 00:01:33.480
and put it into their shot and drink it.

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:34.457
- Oh boy.

00:01:34.457 --> 00:01:35.571
- Oh yeah.

00:01:35.571 --> 00:01:36.701
- He wiggled a little bit.

00:01:36.701 --> 00:01:37.534
- Yeah.

00:01:38.651 --> 00:01:41.210
- [Narrator] As delicious as
that seafood beverage sounds

00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:44.867
people come just because
the fact that the bar exists

00:01:44.867 --> 00:01:46.295
is pretty amazing.

00:01:46.295 --> 00:01:50.049
- People's reactions to
this bar are from crazy

00:01:50.049 --> 00:01:52.027
to they don't understand it

00:01:52.027 --> 00:01:54.635
to it's the coolest thing ever.

00:01:54.635 --> 00:01:56.137
They come from all over
the world to see it.

00:01:56.137 --> 00:01:58.707
It's very seasonal, we're
only opened 20 days.

00:01:58.707 --> 00:02:01.484
If you're ever near Lake Lida,

00:02:01.484 --> 00:02:04.148
drive out on the ice,
park, come into the bar

00:02:04.148 --> 00:02:05.481
and grab a pole.

